#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:115
msgid "Vessa, the youngest and least patient apprentice, rides out the night she hears of it. Malrik of Shadow got there first and is camped at the far end of the ruins. He cannot light a brazier. She can."
msgstr ""

